# colors shows the 256 colours of the colour map. A click with button 1 on a colour shows its values at the top left. The exit item of the menu of button 3 stops it.
class exact
window 400x400
run colors
quiet
snap map
# Rio can use the first click in a new window to make the window current, and then colors does not get it. Thus the script clicks the same colour two times, and the image is the same in both cases. The point 100,100 is in a cell, and 200,200 is on a line between cells.
mouse 1 at 100,100
quiet
mouse 1 at 100,100
quiet
snap value
mouse 3 at 200,200
exit none
